cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and the dataset."
title: "PSCK-MoIQP: IQP Born machines for calorimeter shower profiles"
abstract: >-
  Classical training and compilation code for Mixture-of-IQP Born
  machines with the Pearson-Stabilized Correlation Kernel. Includes the Van den
  Nest correlator estimator, the Walsh-Hadamard compilation to a single IQP
  circuit, and the loss certificate.
